-- =============================================================================
-- Most "drone" models (including the Oblivion drone) ship as VEHICLE add-ons,
-- which cannot be spawned as a ped. So the ped stays as the invisible brain and
-- the model is attached to it as a purely cosmetic shell.
--
-- The shell is created LOCALLY on each client (not networked): it hangs off the
-- networked ped, so its position/rotation sync through the ped for free and
-- there is no second networked entity whose ownership has to be managed.

